# The afterimage's rate is the one number GMS never prints. Every language
# says only "fires at set intervals", and the client does NOT hold it: neither
# 400031020 nor 400031021 has a `summon` node, which is the mark of a pulse
# clocked server-side -- see periodic_intervals. So the rate is the user's own
# observation, one attack a second, and `subTime 180` is not it. An earlier
# reading took that 180 for the tick and had the afterimage firing five times
# as fast.
#
# GMS gives the buff 30 seconds and the afterimages 3, then hands them 3 more
# for every second their attacks land, up to the buff. A Bow Master never
# stops attacking, so the window is the buff: the ramp is dropped and the
# afterimages fire for the whole 30.
#
# One enemy a volley. GMS states no mobCount for this skill, and while the box
# is wide enough for 24 by the reach rule, that rule floors a stated cap
# rather than lifting an absent one -- the arrow is fired at an enemy ahead.
#
# The passive half counts ten of the character's own attacks, and nothing here
# says what one is worth: Hurricane's own hits_per_attack_count divides it, so
# a rate written in swings holds whatever they are swinging and moves on its
# own if Hurricane ever changes. Its afterimage stands `q` = 1 second and
# strikes once a second, so it gets ONE attack of 3 lines -- GMS states a
# lifetime and an attackCount and never a repeat count.
name: "Inhuman Speed"
description:
  "Causes you to attack so quickly you produce afterimages. Unaffected by "
  "attack reflection. After performing a certain number of attacks while the "
  "active effect of the skill isn't active, an afterimage is created that "
  "attacks for a short time."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BOW_MASTER_V skill_order: 2 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 30.0
  pulse {
    label: "Afterimage"
    cast_interval_seconds: 1.0
    max_enemies: 1
    lines: 3
    base { skill_pct: 4.16 }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.16 }
  }
}
auto_mode {
  label: "Passive Afterimage"
  attacks_per_cast: 10
  max_enemies: 1
  lines: 3
  silent_while_buff_stands: true
  base { skill_pct: 4.16 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.16 }
}
